1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,352
Stop scrolling!

2
00:00:01,402 --> 00:00:04,249
Born in the Year of the Rabbit?

3
00:00:04,299 --> 00:00:06,772
Your luck isn't good today.

4
00:00:06,822 --> 00:00:09,950
But don't worry, watch to the end.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,505
Today, 26 October, is a Rooster day

6
00:00:12,555 --> 00:00:14,768
and the Rabbit sits opposite it

7
00:00:14,818 --> 00:00:16,300
in the zodiac circle.

8
00:00:16,350 --> 00:00:18,344
Some days, things just don't

9
00:00:18,394 --> 00:00:19,950
go the way we planned.

10
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,617
And that's okay.

11
00:00:21,667 --> 00:00:24,533
Everyone has days like this.

12
00:00:24,583 --> 00:00:27,554
A quiet day is not a bad day.

13
00:00:27,604 --> 00:00:29,950
It is a day to breathe.

14
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,248
Be careful today:

15
00:00:31,298 --> 00:00:33,232
you can be overly cautious

16
00:00:33,282 --> 00:00:35,828
and avoid necessary confrontation.

17
00:00:35,878 --> 00:00:37,965
Notice it, and give yourself

18
00:00:38,015 --> 00:00:39,950
a moment before you react.

19
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:44,046
Be gentle with the people you love

20
00:00:44,096 --> 00:00:46,215
and with yourself.

21
00:00:46,265 --> 00:00:49,950
And lean on a friend you trust.

22
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,700
At work and with money

23
00:00:52,750 --> 00:00:55,950
take small, careful steps.

24
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:59,950
Finish one thing, then the next.

25
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:02,712
Slow is still moving forward.

26
00:01:02,762 --> 00:01:05,950
Every quiet day makes you stronger

27
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:07,569
and brighter days

28
00:01:07,619 --> 00:01:09,950
are already on their way.

29
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:11,648
Rest well tonight.

30
00:01:11,698 --> 00:01:13,629
Tomorrow is a new day

31
00:01:13,679 --> 00:01:15,705
and it could be yours.

32
00:01:15,755 --> 00:01:17,403
Follow MyBirthSign

33
00:01:17,453 --> 00:01:19,950
for your fortune every day!
